---
// The short label with a gold rule above a story, event or statement title.
---

<p class="eyebrow"><span class="rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><slot /></p>

<style>
	.eyebrow {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 14px;
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-bronze);
	}

	.rule {
		inline-size: 44px;
		block-size: 2px;
		background: var(--color-gold);
	}
</style>
